**`lib/posts.ts`** - Server Action with cache invalidation:
```typescript
export async function createPost(title: string, content: string): Promise<Post> {
  const post = { id: crypto.randomUUID(), title, content, createdAt: new Date() };
  posts.push(post);
  revalidateTag('posts', 'max');  // Immediately invalidates cached 'posts' tag
  return post;
}
```

**`app/page.tsx`** - Client component that calls the server action via `useTransition`.

The `revalidateTag('posts', 'max')` call ensures:
- The "posts" cache tag is purged immediately
- The `'max'` profile guarantees no stale-while-revalidate - the next request will wait for fresh data
- User will **never** see stale cached content after creating a post
